**② Have you (ever) been to...? 问答**

| 问 | 肯定答 | 否定答 |
|---|---|---|
| **Have you ever been** to Yosemite? | Yes, I **have**. | No, I **haven''t**. |

**③ ever / never**：ever 用在疑问（曾经）；never 用在陈述（从未）——I''ve **never** been there.

**④ 次数表达**：once（一次）/ twice（两次）/ three **times**。

